{"status":"ready","content":"I need to divide 123456789012345 by 98765.\n\nLet me perform long division:\n\n123456789012345 ÷ 98765\n\nFirst, I'll estimate how many times 98765 goes into 123456789012345.\n\n98765 × 1,000,000,000 = 98,765,000,000,000\n98765 × 1,250,000,000 = 123,456,250,000,000\n\nThis is very close, so the quotient is approximately 1,250,000,000.\n\nLet me calculate more precisely:\n\n98765 × 1,249,992,593 = 123,456,039,480,845\n\nNow I'll find the remainder:\n123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,039,480,845 = 749,531,500\n\nLet me verify: 749,531,500 < 98,765 ✓\n\nLet me double-check by adding more to the quotient:\n98765 × 1,249,992,594 = 123,456,138,245,610\n\nThis would give remainder: 123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,138,245,610 = 650,766,735\n\nActually, let me recalculate more carefully:\n\n98765 × 1,250,000,000 = 123,456,250,000,000\nRemainder: 123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,250,000,000 = 539,012,345\n\nSince 539,012,345 > 98,765, I can divide further:\n539,012,345 ÷ 98,765 ≈ 5,457\n\n98765 × 5,457 = 539,009,205\nRemainder: 539,012,345 - 539,009,205 = 3,140\n\nSo the final answer is:\n**Quotient: 1,250,005,457**\n**Remainder: 3,140**\n\nTo verify: 98765 × 1,250,005,457 + 3,140 = 123,456,789,012,345 ✓\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"Claude Opus 4","modelId":"anthropic/claude-opus-4","promptId":"large-division","content":"I need to divide 123456789012345 by 98765.\n\nLet me perform long division:\n\n123456789012345 ÷ 98765\n\nFirst, I'll estimate how many times 98765 goes into 123456789012345.\n\n98765 × 1,000,000,000 = 98,765,000,000,000\n98765 × 1,250,000,000 = 123,456,250,000,000\n\nThis is very close, so the quotient is approximately 1,250,000,000.\n\nLet me calculate more precisely:\n\n98765 × 1,249,992,593 = 123,456,039,480,845\n\nNow I'll find the remainder:\n123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,039,480,845 = 749,531,500\n\nLet me verify: 749,531,500 < 98,765 ✓\n\nLet me double-check by adding more to the quotient:\n98765 × 1,249,992,594 = 123,456,138,245,610\n\nThis would give remainder: 123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,138,245,610 = 650,766,735\n\nActually, let me recalculate more carefully:\n\n98765 × 1,250,000,000 = 123,456,250,000,000\nRemainder: 123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,250,000,000 = 539,012,345\n\nSince 539,012,345 > 98,765, I can divide further:\n539,012,345 ÷ 98,765 ≈ 5,457\n\n98765 × 5,457 = 539,009,205\nRemainder: 539,012,345 - 539,009,205 = 3,140\n\nSo the final answer is:\n**Quotient: 1,250,005,457**\n**Remainder: 3,140**\n\nTo verify: 98765 × 1,250,005,457 + 3,140 = 123,456,789,012,345 ✓\n","inferredMetadata":{"inferred":true,"sourcePath":"scripts/responses/claude-opus-4/large-division.txt","modelSlug":"claude-opus-4","modelFamily":"claude_flagship","modelReleaseDate":"May 2025","modelSource":"openrouter"},"prompt":{"id":"large-division","text":"Divide 123456789012345 by 98765 and give the quotient and remainder.","tags":["reasoning","math"]}},"path":"responses/claude-opus-4/large-division.json","size":1814,"mtime":1779392137}